desc: Extract the 100 ERR lines from 200, reformat, and reverse
category: expert
par: 48
hint1: Inverse-filter the noise first; then .* is greedy enough to swallow the whole prefix in one bite.
hint2: A bare :s/ / bites only the first space; ending a sub before its final delimiter is legal; :g/^/m0 stands every line on its head.
